config BR2_PACKAGE_BLUETOOTHD_TEST
	bool "bluetoothd-test"
	help
	  Hardware-confirmed static BlueZ 5.66 bluetoothd (Run 5,
	  2026-08-19) plus its dbus-policy config files, from
	  prado-firmware-reconstruction's tools/bluetoothd-test/. Static
	  and glibc-version-agnostic on purpose (see that tool's own
	  README's "Why static" section) -- NOT rebuilt from source here,
	  same prebuilt-binary reuse as this project's other
	  Buildroot-external packages (libgal, libmali, etc).

	  Not BR2_PACKAGE_BLUEZ5 -- see merry-snacking-wirth.md's Phase 1
	  re-scope note for why BlueZ itself isn't a from-source Buildroot
	  package in this rootfs.
